📢 Human organs and tissue missing from bodies in Ukraine — RT’s investigation

A soldier’s remains sent across Ukraine — state contracts worth millions and shipments heading abroad.

The trail of Ukraine’s human tissue trade:

🟥 RT examined court documents from an investigation in Chernovtsy and found records it says point to at least 130 cases of alleged illegal removal of human material; 

🟥 The documents identify state-owned Bioimplant and private supplier Probones as recipients;

🟥 38 biomaterial contracts awarded to Bioimplant and Probones, worth 60.8 million hryvnas ($1.3M) between 2024 and 2026;

🟥 Trade records also show 67 Bioimplant export shipments to countries including Germany, the UK and the Netherlands.

Source: RT

